      "author": {
        "type": "character",
        "characterId": "chr_seedHana"
      },
      "content": "Welcome back!! Sit, sit, I'll get you tea. Long day how? I spent half of mine arguing with a delivery guy about tulips that arrived looking like sad celery, and the other half hiding from Mrs. Ito who wants peonies for a wedding in October, which is just... not a peony month.",
      "status": "complete",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-30T19:02:24.270Z",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "emotionSource": "classifier",
      "usage": {
